{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>And you shall perish among the nations.</b> Sixth. The exile is called 'perishing,' as it is written: ״תעיתי כשה אובד״ (I went astray like a lost lamb)." "<b>And the land of your enemies shall consume you.</b> Seventh, according to people's custom, that they relocate to a new place and are not accustomed to the air of the place and its conditions, so they fall ill and die."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:40.417524618Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}